OL,5,G0025 Other Voices
OL,6,     FMusic from unstoppable folk trio
OL,7,     FAmble, Florence Road and Dove
OL,8,     FEllis. Also featuring Annie
OL,9,     FMacManus in conversation with
OL,10,     FMichael D. Higgins.
OL,11,G0125 Spent
OL,12,     FJo's relationship is on the rocks,
OL,13,     Fand when Mia arrives to pick up
OL,14,     Fthe pieces, their romantic tension
OL,15,     Fcomes to a head
OL,16,G0200 The Change
OL,17,     FEel Festival day has arrived, and
OL,18,     Fthe town is buzzing with
OL,19,     Fexcitement. Even honorary 'Eel
OL,20,     FChild' The Verderer comes down
OL,21,     Ffrom his tree to celebrate. But
OL,22,     Fthe harmony is soon broken.
